    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Karachi, 10th Sept, 2005: Aga Khan University Hospital's (AKUH) Department of Anaesthesia organised its fifth Pain Symposium titled 'Recent Developments in Pain Management: Conventional to Interventional Approaches', which was attended by a large number of anaesthesiologists, oncologists, neurologists, neurosurgeons, obstetricians and physicians from around the world.",
